<title>JAPAN: Sapporo Breweries to boost production capacity.</title>
<headline>Sapporo Breweries to boost production capacity.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sapporo Breweries Ltd said on Thursday that it plans to invest 23 billion yen to boost production capacity at its seven plants in Japan before the end of this year.</p>
<p>As a result of the move, the company's domestic production capacity will rise six percent to 1.51 million kilolitres per year, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>The daily production capacity for canned beer  will increase 17 percent to about 4.7 million cans per day, the spokesman said.</p>
